    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d310-a2">

                <pb facs="0351" n="267" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg267"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-10-03"><hi rendition="#italic">October 3,
                        1902</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of the Navy</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington, D. C.:</hi></p>
                <p>Have sent this communication to the American consul at Panama:</p>
                <p>“Inform governor while trains running under United States protection I must
                    decline transportation any combatants, ammunition, arms, which might cause
                    interruption traffic or convert line of transit into theater hostilities.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Casey.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
